{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011CftHBVicHLe44XqUH5SMa","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Don't commit to the full build yet.** Use the ten days to test whether organisers would actually use a weekly summary.\n\nThe evidence so far is stated intent from three people, with no observed failures, usage data, or payment signal.\n\nHypotheses to test (unverified):\n- **H1:** Scattered threads cost organisers real time or cause missed decisions.\n- **H2:** They would trust an AI summary enough to act on it without rereading the threads.\n- **H3:** They would pay for it or commit to a pilot.\n\nSuggested plan:\n1. **Days 1–3:** Interview the three organisers using their recent threads. Measure catch-up time and missed items (tests H1).\n2. **Days 4–7:** Build a throwaway tool: paste exported threads in, get a summary out. No accounts or integrations (tests H2).\n3. **Days 8–10:** Have each organiser use it on real threads and note whether they send or edit the output (tests H2, H3).\n\nSet the go/no-go rule now: continue only if all three use it on real threads and at least two commit to a pilot. Otherwise stop."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3205,"cache_read_input_tokens":9381,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3205},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"98d81981-02d8-4dcc-ba53-dd654911b49a","uuid":"e549c853-9528-4315-b2bc-e8abbd405a60","timestamp":"2026-10-10T08:58:06.493Z","request_id":"req_011CftHBVTEX4Qudv7p8enDZ"}
